---
title: How to batch-process PDFs
description: Compress, rotate, watermark, or protect many PDFs at once and download a ZIP.
relatedTool: batch-pdf
---

Run the same action on multiple PDFs without opening each file separately.

## Steps

1. Open **Batch PDF**.
2. Add two or more PDF files.
3. Choose an action (compress, rotate, watermark, protect, flatten, remove metadata).
4. Adjust options, then process — download a ZIP of results.

## Tips

> **Tip:** Drop several files on the homepage to jump straight into Batch or Merge with smart suggestions.

